{
  "esm": "1.2.0",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "scale-county-timeagg-month-runspec",
    "description": "PLAN.md §7.3.63, step 7f. `scale-county-timeagg-month`: `scale-county-timeagg-day`'s selections at January, April, July and October 2020, with `<aggregateBy key=\"Month\"/>` and `<outputtimestep value=\"Year\"/>`, over the same county database (`inputs/washtenaw-county-timeagg.esm`). MOVESOutput is 6,288 rows.\n\nWHAT IT DISCRIMINATES is PreAggMONTH.sql on top of PreAggDAY.sql, before any generator: startsPerDay collapsed to `sum(startsPerDay x dayID / 7)`, startsOpModeDistribution weighted by `dayID x startsPerDayPerVehicle`, startsHourFraction and hotellingHourFraction renormalised over the week, hotellingHoursPerDay to `sum(hours x noOfRealDays / 7)`, sourceTypeHour's hotellingDist by DayWeighting2, AvgSpeedDistribution by DayWeighting1 -- which no longer cancels, because the run aggregates TWO day types -- and totalIdleFraction by DayWeighting2Normalized. Measured in pandas against the execution database before the port: startsOpModeDistribution 984 of 984 at 3.9e-16, startsPerDayPerVehicle exact, sourceTypeHour at 2.2e-16, AvgSpeedDistribution 192 of 192 at 4.5e-06 (0.36 with the days unweighted), totalIdleFraction 120 of 120 at 2.3e-08 (DayWeighting2Normalized is a FLOAT column), ZoneMonthHour at 6.8e-10 (PLAN.md §7.3.63).\n\n`n_outputRate` is bound to 6288, the (pollutant-process, cohort) pairs per (county, month) cell, recomputed as `rateSurvivorCount`.\n\n`db_movesoutput` is DECLARED AND CONSUMED BY NOTHING, as in every RunSpec here.",
    "authors": [
      "EarthSciML Authors and Contributors"
    ],
    "tags": [
      "fixture",
      "onroad",
      "default-database",
      "single-county-domain",
      "road-type-axis",
      "off-network-idle",
      "hotelling-adjustment",
      "time-aggregation",
      "starts",
      "output-time-step"
    ]
  },
  "data_sources": {
    "db_runspecyear": {
      "kind": "static",
      "source": {
        "url_template": "../../moves.rs/characterization/snapshots/scale-county-timeagg-month/tables/db__movesexecution1ccc0236_campuscluster_illinois_edu__runspecyear.parquet"
      },
      "extent": {
        "metaparameter": "n_runspecyear"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "tags": [
          "scope"
        ],
        "note": "1 row, yearID 2020. The scope comes from these tables and never from the RunSpec XML, whose @key attributes are 0-based indices into sorted ID lists (docs/mixed-onroad.md §0.1).",
        "esio_format": "parquet"
      }
    },
    "db_runspecmonth": {
      "kind": "static",
      "source": {
        "url_template": "../../moves.rs/characterization/snapshots/scale-county-timeagg-month/tables/db__movesexecution1ccc0236_campuscluster_illinois_edu__runspecmonth.parquet"
      },
      "extent": {
        "metaparameter": "n_runspecmonth"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "tags": [
          "scope"
        ],
        "note": "4 rows, monthIDs 1, 4, 7 and 10 (`<month key=\"0\"/>` to `\"9\"` are 0-based).",
        "esio_format": "parquet"
      }
    },
    "db_runspechour": {
      "kind": "static",
      "source": {
        "url_template": "../../moves.rs/characterization/snapshots/scale-county-timeagg-month/tables/db__movesexecution1ccc0236_campuscluster_illinois_edu__runspechour.parquet"
      },
      "extent": {
        "metaparameter": "n_runspechour"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "tags": [
          "scope"
        ],
        "note": "1 row, hourID 0 -- the SYNTHESIZED `Entire Day`. The RunSpec selects all 24 hours.",
        "esio_format": "parquet"
      }
    },
    "db_aggregationhour": {
      "kind": "static",
      "source": {
        "url_template": "../movesdb/HourOfAnyDay.parquet"
      },
      "extent": {
        "metaparameter": "n_aggregationhour"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "tags": [
          "scope"
        ],
        "note": "THE 24 HOURS the run aggregates over: the default database's own `HourOfAnyDay` (PreAggDAY.sql).",
        "esio_format": "parquet"
      }
    },
    "db_runspecday": {
      "kind": "static",
      "source": {
        "url_template": "../../moves.rs/characterization/snapshots/scale-county-timeagg-month/tables/db__movesexecution1ccc0236_campuscluster_illinois_edu__runspechourday.parquet"
      },
      "extent": {
        "metaparameter": "n_runspecday"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "tags": [
          "scope"
        ],
        "note": "1 row, hourDayID 0 -- the SYNTHESIZED `Whole Week` cell PreAggMONTH.sql writes, which `dayofanyweek` does not name, so every time cell belongs to it.",
        "esio_format": "parquet"
      }
    },
    "db_rateday": {
      "kind": "static",
      "source": {
        "url_template": "./selections/scale-county-timeagg-month-rateday.parquet"
      },
      "extent": {
        "metaparameter": "n_rateday"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "tags": [
          "scope"
        ],
        "note": "THE DAY TYPES THE RUNSPEC SELECTED, dayIDs 2 and 5, read out of the RunSpec XML by `tools/runspec-day-selection.py` into `runspecs/selections/scale-county-timeagg-month-rateday.parquet`: MOVES overwrites `RunSpecDay` with the synthesized day 0 AFTER the pre-aggregation has run (conventions §66.4). The execution database's tables were cut to these days before PreAggMONTH.sql collapsed them, so every collapse sums over them -- startsPerDay's `dayID/7`, startsOpModeDistribution's `dayID x startsPerDayPerVehicle`, the DayWeighting means.",
        "esio_format": "parquet"
      }
    },
    "db_actday": {
      "kind": "static",
      "source": {
        "url_template": "../movesdb/DayOfAnyWeek.parquet"
      },
      "extent": {
        "metaparameter": "n_actday"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "tags": [
          "scope"
        ],
        "note": "THE DAY TYPES THE ACTIVITY COVERS: the default database's own `DayOfAnyWeek`, both of them -- the whole week (`noOfRealDays` 7).",
        "esio_format": "parquet"
      }
    },
    "db_runspecsourcetype": {
      "kind": "static",
      "source": {
        "url_template": "../../moves.rs/characterization/snapshots/scale-county-timeagg-month/tables/db__movesexecution1ccc0236_campuscluster_illinois_edu__runspecsourcetype.parquet"
